blurb: The South Portland School Board voted to delay the elementary school reconfiguration
  timeline to Fall 2027, allowing for more thorough planning and community input.
  The meeting also featured recognitions for outstanding achievements, a detailed
  budget update, and a discussion on special education staffing, culminating in requests
  to the City Council for financial support to address budget shortfalls and build
  contingency.
